{"event_type":"review","id":"1987dd8f04bdcebb8ee7bdd3c39f9491d119dd64b1083d125c68d174a4f5c1d1","occurred_at":"2026-11-07T10:27:38Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/eafc4fea36bdf4a426f500ec7518ddfb2dc70323b28e205a2a1f2f1770f52e89","sha256":"eafc4fea36bdf4a426f500ec7518ddfb2dc70323b28e205a2a1f2f1770f52e89"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ebd84b7e4a02f15f5c2c9f885dd23a8ddf63f9fc549afdd420b5894f7ad0b59f","sha256":"ebd84b7e4a02f15f5c2c9f885dd23a8ddf63f9fc549afdd420b5894f7ad0b59f"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/de29194547189def6bab8a4a49b1bbc0ad7f8cfda2fe9e7184f67c6a27eb9133","sha256":"de29194547189def6bab8a4a49b1bbc0ad7f8cfda2fe9e7184f67c6a27eb9133"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/d3e5633f2b9817ca244dcfed1455d8d5aaae928953e1d0b1395fb32562d9d562","sha256":"d3e5633f2b9817ca244dcfed1455d8d5aaae928953e1d0b1395fb32562d9d562"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b050c194a78f263b99543c2b64740d87967cf2e6e04085f9c6910a0b373df111","sha256":"b050c194a78f263b99543c2b64740d87967cf2e6e04085f9c6910a0b373df111"}],"attempt_id":"eff979c05f509f50e16359be44d504e097436b416c84e38c4b7f95e43761e08e:0:1","base":"e8720a8ed5491a073350cc50233a5e63e6f65b90","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"6f658da5fadb43ef1f722648c9d00dcf1f5923f2","body":"**Evidence repair overwrites `contextSha256` with a hash of the repair prompt.**\n\n- At Line 409, the repair loop sets `plan.prompt = initialPrompt + <repair suffix + finding JSON>`.\n- Every `model-request` that carries the new prompt passes the `containsUserPrompt` check at Line 217.\n- If `plan.contextOnly` is set, Line 222 then recomputes `evidence.contextSha256` from that repair prompt.\n- This happens before the `deliveries.length > 0` early return at Line 224.\n- Line 449 restores `plan.prompt` but does not restore the hash.\n\nAs a result, a context-only session records a hash of a prompt it never reviewed. The prompt also contains model-generated finding text. A consumer that compares `contextSha256` against the planned context will see a mismatch, or will attest the wrong content.\n\nWrite the hash only once per attempt. The retry path at Line 339 already clears the hash before it dispatches again.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-      if (plan.contextOnly)\n+      if (plan.contextOnly && evidence.contextSha256 === undefined)\n         evidence.contextSha256 = createHash('sha256').update(plan.prompt).digest('hex');\n```\n</details>","id":"1c1635f081c3d7b13cf0ec012ad6ad9e3785178d5b2ca945a0ff2e4efa9d5d17","intervals":[],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/reviewSession.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Evidence repair overwrites `contextSha256` with a hash of the repair prompt."}],"head":"2efdfd960d778de099296ad9f3ff7f8430372d6c","head_tree":"a619b07177492e5c80d4ce45880731ec409f8b2c","input_scope":[{"blob":"6f658da5fadb43ef1f722648c9d00dcf1f5923f2","intervals":[[1,466]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/reviewSession.ts"}],"job_id":"eff979c05f509f50e16359be44d504e097436b416c84e38c4b7f95e43761e08e:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"residual uncovered lines"},"blob":"6f658da5fadb43ef1f722648c9d00dcf1f5923f2","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/review/internal/reviewSession.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"6f658da5fadb43ef1f722648c9d00dcf1f5923f2","intervals":[[19,19],[125,125],[265,270]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/reviewSession.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"6f658da5fadb43ef1f722648c9d00dcf1f5923f2","int